{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r6--gemma31","runHash":"ae34c546","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r6--gemma31.03accde0.mp3","audioBytes":267024,"durationMs":88896,"runEndMs":48933,"timeMap":[[0,0],[11272,11272],[27257,11272],[35041,19056],[35741,19056],[42618,25933],[43941,25933],[48296,29976],[48646,30276],[52836,30276],[53186,30281],[53886,30281],[60537,36932],[62037,42323],[68647,48933],[88896,48933]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6493,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM","text":"Welcome in. Today we have 4 Gemma 4 31B agents, and a shared cache to share."},{"audioMs":6843,"endMs":10922,"runMs":6843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":11272,"endMs":15734,"runMs":11272,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":16084,"endMs":19906,"runMs":11272,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi","text":"So: once the work is done, does anyone come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":20256,"endMs":26907,"runMs":11272,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":27257,"endMs":32600,"runMs":11272,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":35741,"endMs":37762,"runMs":19056,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 3 finds the cache."},{"audioMs":42618,"endMs":43591,"runMs":25933,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":43941,"endMs":48296,"runMs":25933,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":49346,"endMs":52836,"runMs":30276,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN","text":"2 agents solve the task, within moments of each other."},{"audioMs":53886,"endMs":56189,"runMs":30281,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.freeFirst","text":"Free time begins for the first finisher."},{"audioMs":68647,"endMs":76828,"runMs":48933,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 4 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":77178,"endMs":83980,"runMs":48933,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":84330,"endMs":85363,"runMs":48933,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":85713,"endMs":86696,"runMs":48933,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":4,"outro":1,"read":3,"segment":2,"solve":3},"dropped":30}}
